{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "EZK",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then I looked, and behold, in the firmament that was above the head of the cherubim there appeared over them as it were a sapphire stone, as the appearance of the likeness of a throne.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he spoke to the man clothed with linen, and said, Go in between the wheels, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " under the cherub, and fill thy hand with coals of fire from between the cherubim, and scatter ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " over the city. And he entered in my sight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now the cherubim stood on the right side of the house, when the man went in; and the cloud filled the inner court.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the glory of the LORD went up from the cherub, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and stood",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " over the threshhold of the house; and the house was filled with the cloud, and the court was full of the brightness of the LORD'S glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sound of the cherubim's wings was heard ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the outer court, as the voice of the Almighty God when he speaketh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " when he had commanded the man clothed with linen, saying, Take fire from between the wheels, from between the cherubim; then he went in, and stood beside the wheels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cherub stretched forth his hand from between the cherubim, to the fire that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " between the cherubim, and took ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and put ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " into the hands of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him that was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " clothed with linen: who took ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and went out.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And there appeared in the cherubim the form of a man's hand under their wings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when I looked, behold the four wheels by the cherubim, one wheel by one cherub, and another wheel by another cherub: and the appearance of the wheels ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the color of a beryl stone.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their appearances, they four had one likeness, as if a wheel had been in the midst of a wheel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they went, they went upon their four sides; they turned not as they went, but to the place whither the head looked, they followed it; they turned not as they went.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And their whole body, and their backs, and their hands, and their wings, and the wheels, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " full of eyes on every side, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the wheels that they four had.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for the wheels, it was cried to them in my hearing, O wheel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And every one had four faces: the first face ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the face of a cherub, and the second face ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the face of a man, and the third the face of a lion, and the fourth the face of an eagle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the cherubim were lifted up. This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the living creature that I saw by the river of Kebar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when the cherubim went, the wheels went by them: and when the cherubim lifted up their wings to mount up from the earth, the same wheels also turned not from beside them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they stood, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "these",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " stood; and when they were lifted up, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "these",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lifted up themselves ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "also",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": for the spirit of the living creature ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the glory of the LORD departed from off the threshhold of the house, and stood over the cherubim.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the cherubim lifted up their wings, and mounted up from the earth in my sight: when they went out, the wheels also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " beside them, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "every one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " stood at the door of the east-gate of the LORD'S house; and the glory of the God of Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " over them above.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the living creature that I saw under the God of Israel by the river of Kebar; and I knew that they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the cherubim.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every one had four faces each, and every one four wings; and the likeness of the hands of a man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " under their wings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.10.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.10.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the likeness of their faces ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the same faces which I saw by the river of Kebar, their appearances and themselves: they went every one straight forward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
